OL,3,AInside the room: What it was like to be
OL,4,Awith Blackpink's Lisa as race scandal
OL,5,Aerupted
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhat's it like to be the main character
OL,8,Fof an online scandal?
OL,10,FThat's one of the questions raised in a
OL,11,Fnew documentary about Lisa Manobal `
OL,12,Fone quarter of K-pop phenomenon
OL,13,FBlackpink and a breakout star of TV
OL,14,Fshow The White Lotus.
OL,16,FThe film captures an unfolding
OL,17,Fcontroversy, as leaked videos show
OL,18,FBlackpink using racial slurs when they
OL,19,Fwere teenage trainees in the K-pop
OL,20,Fsystem.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
